OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 120 homes in village set
OL,4,Ato be refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to planning documents, the
OL,7,Fdeveloper has proposed providing a
OL,8,Fconvenience store and funding an
OL,9,Fimprovement to bus services in the
OL,10,Fvillage.
OL,12,FHowever, a report prepared for
OL,13,Fcouncillors states the proposed
OL,14,Fdevelopment "would not be in a
OL,15,Fsustainable location for its scale".
